  "slug": "schools",
  "section": "The Disruption",
  "title": "The AI Pause Leaves High School Homework Untouched",
  "subtitle": "The pause for younger children is defensible. High schools need a rule for take-home essays and a warning about AI detectors.",
  "category": "Education",
