  "title": "Make the City’s AI Contract Terms Public and Mandatory",
  "subtitle": "New York City’s technology office has written standard AI terms for software contracts. They should be published and required, with added clauses on accuracy, false alarms and the City’s right to walk away.",
  "category": "Procurement",
